; nextcloud-handler functional test, run in the OS4 guest with NC1: mounted
; (since 0.38: "Assign NC1: NCH:Test", a server of the test server list)
FailAt 21
Echo "== download"
Copy NC1:big5.bin RAM:nch/big5.bin CLONE
Echo "== upload"
Copy RAM:nch/big5.bin NC1:big5_up.bin CLONE
Echo "== case"
Type NC1:hello.TXT
Echo ""
Echo "== mkdir/copy/rename/note/date"
MakeDir NC1:NewDir
Copy NC1:Hello.txt NC1:NewDir/
Rename NC1:NewDir/Hello.txt NC1:NewDir/Renamed.txt
FileNote NC1:NewDir/Renamed.txt "A comment"
SetDate NC1:NewDir/Renamed.txt 01-Jan-20 12:00:00
List NC1:NewDir
Echo "== delete full dir (must fail)"
Delete NC1:NewDir
Echo "== delete all"
Delete NC1:NewDir ALL
Echo "== protect"
Protect NC1:Hello.txt +s
Echo "== info"
Info NC1:
Echo "== done"
